<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>金德勒：市场波动不太可能持续</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/market-volatility-highly-unlikely-to-continue-kindler-video</link><description>Paul, Weiss, Rifkind, Wharton &amp; Garrison 并购集团全球主席 Robert Kindler 与 Dani Burger 一起参加“彭博交易”。他们讨论了创纪录的并购速度。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/market-volatility-highly-unlikely-to-continue-kindler-video'&gt;金德勒：市场波动不太可能持续&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Market Volatility Highly Unlikely To Continue: Kindler&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/market-volatility-highly-unlikely-to-continue-kindler-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:23:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Bounces Back Above $3,500 as Yields, Dollar Retreat&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Pare AI-Driven Losses as Dip Buyers Step In: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场大幅复苏，人为指数从下跌 10% 开始反弹 |结束钟声</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/anthropic-rebounds-from-selloff-closing-bell-video</link><description>Romaine Bostick、Carol Massar 和 Lisa Mateo 在彭博电视台、彭博广播电台和 YouTube 上对美国市场进行全面跨平台报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/anthropic-rebounds-from-selloff-closing-bell-video'&gt;随着市场大幅复苏，人为指数从下跌 10% 开始反弹 |结束钟声&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Rebounds From 10% Drop as Markets Stage Dramatic Recovery | Closing Bell&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/anthropic-rebounds-from-selloff-closing-bell-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:38:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks End Day Lower as AI-Driven Swings Whipsaw Investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>